      "id": 21912,
      "name": "Christopher",
      "username": "Christopher",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-31T01:55:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Shhhh, leaking some knowledge here!</p>\n<p>The first expansion will be called “Sentinels of the Multiverse: AGAIN!”</p>\n<p>It will include Baron Blade’s Son, Citizen Dawn’s sister, Grand Warlord Voss’s second in command who took over after the defeat of Voss, and Omnitron’s wife.</p>\n<p>The Environments will be A Different Base on Mars, and “Primal Island”, an island with prehistoric creatures and a volcano!</p>\n<p>The Heroes are twins, joined at the hip, Named “Yin” and “Yan” who use their Dual Cartwheeling powers to fight crime!</p>\n<p>Look forward to it!</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:55:58.848Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
