      "raw": "Shhhh, leaking some knowledge here!\n\nThe first expansion will be called \"Sentinels of the Multiverse: AGAIN!\"\n\nIt will include Baron Blade's Son, Citizen Dawn's sister, Grand Warlord Voss's second in command who took over after the defeat of Voss, and Omnitron's wife.\n\nThe Environments will be A Different Base on Mars, and \"Primal Island\", an island with prehistoric creatures and a volcano!\n\nThe Heroes are twins, joined at the hip, Named \"Yin\" and \"Yan\" who use their Dual Cartwheeling powers to fight crime!\n\nLook forward to it!",
