      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/8edcca/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-31T14:39:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I always think of Omnitron as being on the feminine end of the gender spectrum (since robots do not have biological sex, and it just seems feminine to me) so when I saw “Omnitron’s wife” my first thought was “a lesbian robot!” <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>",
