      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/adam/{size}/1946_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-31T15:54:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Omnitron is most assuredly an “it”, but I think it would have its creator’s voice, which was male. This obviously doesn’t make it male, and its software could be changed to include a female voice should it find a reason to do so, but one voice is as good as another to it, and it would rather not have to communicate with humans at all.</p>",
